<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <http://purl.org/ffonto#V1.2> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://creativecommons.org/ns#license> "" .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/abstract> "The Forest Fire Ontology (FFONTO) is designed to integrate multi-modal sensor data for early fire detection. It serves as an extensible framework with 'ForestFire' as the root class, incorporating concepts for visual detection, audio monitoring, and environmental conditions."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> _:genid1 .
_:genid1 <https://schema.org/identifier> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4520-3819> .
_:genid1 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Prof. Dulani Meedeniya"@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> _:genid2 .
_:genid2 <https://schema.org/identifier> <https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5790-62840> .
_:genid2 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Ms. Charuni Kosala Jayaweera"@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "This ontology describes forest fire detection observations including image, audio, and weather data."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/title> "Forest Fire Ontology (FFONTO)"@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-01-27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "" .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "ffonto"@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ontology for forest fire detection & observation (image, audio, weather). Root class: ForestFire. Designed for extensibility."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://github.com/kosala0514/FFOnto> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Initial Release 1.0" .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#status> "Active" .
