<http://purl.org/ffonto#classifiesVisibility> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.org/ffonto#hasVisibilityCategory> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#classifiesVisibility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/ffonto#VisibilityCategory> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#classifiesVisibility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/ffonto#SmokePlume> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#classifiesVisibility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Connects an observation, sensor, or metric to the categorization of visual range through the atmosphere, which is often degraded by smoke."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#classifiesVisibility> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "classifies visibility"@en .
