<http://purl.org/ffonto#enables> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/ffonto#EdgeDevice> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/ffonto#ComputerVisionTask> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A general relation indicating that one entity makes another action or capability possible."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enables> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "enables on-device inference" .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#enablesOf
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enablesOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enablesOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.org/ffonto#enables> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enablesOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/ffonto#ComputerVisionTask> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enablesOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/ffonto#EdgeDevice> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enablesOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse relation linking capabilities back to the enabling resources or conditions."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enablesOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "inverse of enables"@en .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemService
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemService> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
