<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/ffonto#EcosystemService> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an environmental activity or event to the ecosystem service that it improves or supports." .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "enhances ecosystem service" .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemServiceOf
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemServiceOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
