<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemServiceOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse relation linking enhanced ecosystem services back to the management actions that produce them."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesEcosystemServiceOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "inverse of enhances ecosystem service"@en .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesService
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesService> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://purl.org/ffonto#EcologicalEffect> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://purl.org/ffonto#EcosystemService> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates that an ecological effect (like regeneration) improves a service." .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#enhancesService> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "enhances ecosystem service" .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#ensuresContinuityOf
<http://purl.org/ffonto#ensuresContinuityOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
