<http://purl.org/ffonto#ensuresContinuityOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a system, plan, or entity to the operational process or service it sustains during disruptions."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#ensuresContinuityOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ensures continuity of"@en .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#environmentalAffectedBy
