<http://purl.org/ffonto#environmentalFactorAffectsFireSpread> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a natural condition (like wind or terrain) to its influence on the rate and direction of a fire."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#environmentalFactorAffectsFireSpread> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "environmental factor affects fire spread"@en .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatedBy
<http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
