<http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatedFrom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "estimated from"@en .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatedOf
<http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatedOf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
