<http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatedOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a calculated or predicted value to the physical entity or phenomenon being measured."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatedOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "estimated of"@en .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatesFire
<http://purl.org/ffonto#estimatesFire> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
