<http://purl.org/ffonto#increasesFireRiskOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse relation indicating that an entity increases fire risk for a particular target."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#increasesFireRiskOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "inverse of increases fire risk"@en .
