# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingIndex
<http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingIndex> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indices derived from satellite imagery used to measure fire severity or vegetation condition." .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingIndex> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Remote Sensing Index" .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingMethod
