<http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingMethod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Satellite or radar techniques used to monitor wildfire risk and impacts." .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingMethod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Remote Sensing Method" .
# 
# http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingSensor
<http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingSensor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A sensor used to capture environmental data remotely, such as from satellites, drones, or aircraft."@en .
<http://purl.org/ffonto#RemoteSensingSensor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Remote sensing sensor"@en .
# 
